  "totalBlocks": 25,
  "translatedBlocks": 24,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "771f5e0017628482",
      "translationZh": "适用于 Outlook 的 Grok | SpaceXAI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00f7f3f6a2a77028",
      "translationZh": "使用适用于 Microsoft Outlook 的 Grok 加载项，总结冗长的邮件会话、以你的口吻起草回复，并让收件箱井然有序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43356366a86fd893",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们将 Grok 引入 Microsoft Outlook。这款加载项让智能体在你的收件箱旁随时待命：它能总结冗长的邮件会话、以你的口吻起草回复，并让你的邮箱井然有序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebeef038e32f05a1",
      "translationZh": "新建邮件 删除 存档 回复 全部回复 转发 移动到 规则 加载项 Grok",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57448b642cd41c05",
      "translationZh": "Q3 供应商合同 — 续约",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5f06da3e50ff7f2",
      "translationZh": "法务部门就续约条款给出了反馈",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "428d8207e75bbae0",
      "translationZh": "用五则新闻开启你的一天",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92262ae5a7d28447",
      "translationZh": "登月、马拉松纪录，还有更多",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ac97a8683d3e20f",
      "translationZh": "我们需要财务和法务的批准",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fb411cbaa9d7bc6",
      "translationZh": "main 上的全部 1,204 项检查均已通过",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f95780057c05c2aa",
      "translationZh": "有三个流程需要审阅，演示文稿已附上",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5033fc8b79ffbd89",
      "translationZh": "如果我们在 6 月 30 日前作出承诺，当前费率将保持不变",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de4ae43e365bde03",
      "translationZh": "应计项目须在周三前提交给财务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29ca2b929e40edeb",
      "translationZh": "收件箱 · 12 条消息 · 4 位参与者",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95936bbe498873b0",
      "translationZh": "法务就续约事宜给了反馈。签署前有两项条款需要作出决定：自动续约条款（§4.2）和数据保留附录。已附上修订标记版，其中这两部分均已标出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f81495b2ae2f56dd",
      "translationZh": "如果我们在 June 30 之前确认承诺，价格就能维持现有水平。之后就要按新的目录价执行——相同用量下，价格大约上涨 8%。财务部门已在共享表格中列出了对比。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff43e41219a7258b",
      "translationZh": "安全审查已通过。他们的 SOC 2 报告已存档，而且本期没有新增次级处理者，因此我们这边没有任何阻碍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8675b77e33c398b0",
      "translationZh": "谁能负责合同修订稿？我们需要在周五前获得财务和法务的签核，否则这件事就要推迟到下个季度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e805ee6c4323a5f",
      "translationZh": "项目：128 · 未读：12 100%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8d1de40fe6f47d53",
      "translationZh": "跟进邮件会话，清理积压邮件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b6a8e4d8b5962a9",
      "translationZh": "打开一个持续了一整周的邮件会话，问问发生了什么。Grok 就会告诉你已作出的决定、各项事务的负责人，以及哪些事情仍在等你处理。当邮件越积越多时，它可以一次性清理近期邮件——归档已结束的会话，将无关杂讯移入垃圾邮件，并指出哪些邮件需要回复。这款加载项还能读取附件，并搜索网页和 X，让你无需离开 Outlook 就能查找信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cb74e75bc630fdca",
      "translationZh": "写出符合你风格的回复",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb07122bdf4be085",
      "translationZh": "只需随手写几个词就够了。Grok 会将它们变成符合你写作风格的回复，也可以从头撰写一封新邮件。然后，你可以要求它微调：让主题行更简洁、更换收件人，或让语气更亲切。在你点击发送之前，任何邮件都不会发出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e515bd9b61164260",
      "translationZh": "Grok for Outlook 是一款 Microsoft 365 加载项，即日起面向所有 X 和 SuperGrok 付费用户开放。从 Microsoft Marketplace 添加它，即可在邮箱中直接使用 Grok。也可在 Word、Excel 和 PowerPoint 中使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
